The probability of observing $B$ at a certain read is therefore obtained by a convolution of the
frequency of $B$ alleles and the read error:
\begin{equation}
\label{eq:q_vec}
\textbf{q} = (1-e_r) \frac{1}{2}\hat{M}\textbf{x} +
e_r (1-\frac{1}{2}\hat{M}\textbf{x})
